  "prefLabel": "Emp 301.05 Electronic media",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 301.05 “Electronic media” means any form of portable storage of related information in an electronic format intended for use by a computer including without limitation compact disks, CD-ROMs and encrypted USB flash drives which are compatible with department technology.\n\nSource. #13681, eff 7-3-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Emp 300)",
